    "title": "pandas.DatetimeIndex.to_pydatetime — pandas 2.2.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.DatetimeIndex.to_pydatetime#\n\n- \nDatetimeIndex.to_pydatetime(**args* ,***kwargs* )[source]#\n- Return an ndarray of `datetime.datetime` objects.\n  - Returns:\n    - numpy.ndarray\n Examples >>> idx = pd.date_range('2018-02-27', periods=3) >>> idx.to_pydatetime() array([datetime.datetime(2018, 2, 27, 0, 0), datetime.datetime(2018, 2, 28, 0, 0), datetime.datetime(2018, 3, 1, 0, 0)], dtype=object)",
